      "type": "order_lab",
      "args": {
        "test_code": "unknown"
      },
      "justification": "Anion gap calculation is essential to confirm and quantify DKA severity and will be used to monitor resolution of ketoacidosis. Elevated anion gap confirms metabolic acidosis from ketones."
    },
    {
