      "type": "give_medication",
      "args": {
        "medication_code": "unknown",
        "dose": "standard"
      },
      "justification": "Regular insulin 0.1 units/kg/hr should be initiated after confirming K+ > 3.3 mEq/L per ADA DKA protocol. With potassium replacement underway, insulin infusion can be started to address hyperglycemia and ketoacidosis. This is the cornerstone of DKA treatment after fluid resuscitation and electrolyte stabilization."
    },
    {
